#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
==============================================================================
  B L O C K C R A F T      -  a Minecraft Beta-style survival game, one file
==============================================================================
 Run:       python blockcraft.py
 Needs:     Windows + Python 3.8 or newer.  Nothing to install.
            3D graphics: OpenGL through ctypes (opengl32.dll ships with every
            Windows PC).  World generation and meshing run on the other CPU
            cores (multiprocessing), so the game itself stays smooth.
 Saves:     a "blockcraft_worlds" folder next to this file, and nowhere else.

 Controls   WASD move        SPACE jump / swim / fly up    SHIFT sneak / fly down
            CTRL (or double-tap W) sprint                 MOUSE look
            LEFT CLICK break / attack     RIGHT CLICK place / use / eat / shoot
                                          (with a sword: block - half damage)
            WHEEL or 1-9 hotbar           E inventory     Q drop    T chat
            F1 hide HUD   F2 toggle smooth lighting   F3 debug   F5 camera
            ESC pause menu
 Creative   double-tap SPACE to fly, middle click copies a block
 Nether     build a 4 x 5 obsidian frame, light it with flint and steel, stand in it
 Leo        type /leo in chat - first to solve his maths problem gets 5 diamonds
 The End    kill endermen for ender pearls, blazes (nether fortress) for blaze
            rods; pearl + blaze powder = eye of ender.  Throw eyes: they fly
            toward a stronghold.  Fill the 12 frames in its portal room, jump
            in, destroy the crystals on the pillars, slay the ender dragon, and
            take the portal home.  (/locate stronghold shows the nearest one.)
 Redstone   dust carries power 15 blocks; torches invert; repeaters delay and
            boost; levers, buttons, pressure plates and detector rails switch
            things on; pistons, lamps, doors, TNT, note blocks, dispensers and
            powered rails react.  Minecarts ride on rails (right-click to sit).
 Commands   /xp  /pvp on|off  /locate village|mineshaft|temple|igloo|hut|stronghold
            /pvp (host, LAN): everyone duels in an arena - sword, rod, bow,
            5 arrows, diamond armour; last one standing wins, then home.
 LAN        Pause menu > Open to LAN (host).  Title > Multiplayer (join).
==============================================================================
"""
